            "question": "Tell me about yourself and your journey in the field of Information Technology so far.",
            "transcript": "I am a passionate software engineer specializing in full-stack web development with expertise in JavaScript, React, Node.js, and database performance tuning. I have built scalable microservices and user interfaces.",
