            },
            "question": "Describe a time you encountered a difficult technical bug or project hurdle. How did you troubleshoot it?",
            "transcript": "During a production deployment, I identified a critical memory leak causing backend server crashes under high concurrency. Using Node.js memory profiling and Chrome DevTools heap snapshots, I isolated an unhandled listener leak and refactored the event handling to restore 100% stability.",
